{"3862950": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Knights vs Nature 2", "steam_appid": 3862950, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The kingdom has fallen. Cursed beasts roam the land, and only you can push them back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this fantasy tower defense game, rebuild your broken kingdom and stand against waves of corrupted creatures. Face legendary beasts, uncover ancient mysteries, and track down the source of the corruption; the Goblin Grand Shaman. Build powerful towers, master spells, and take on quests that lead you through forgotten ruins, dark forests, and hostile lands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >⚔️ Classic fantasy tower defense!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏰 17 towers with 12 upgrades each!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌍 Reclaim lost lands and fight back the spreading corruption!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧙 Cast fire, frost, lightning, and more to turn the tide!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🧠 Combine smart tower placement with powerful spells!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🐉 Hunt legendary creatures through quests and special encounters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862950/extras/0fed3b29b954af0a8388aa2164c9552c.poster.avif?t=1765278856\" width=354 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862950/extras/0fed3b29b954af0a8388aa2164c9552c.webm?t=1765278856\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3862950/extras/0fed3b29b954af0a8388aa2164c9552c.mp4?t=1765278856\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstati